### 1. GET ALL ROOMS
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/room/


### 2. ADD ROOM
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/room/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Room_Number": 101,
    "Room_Type": "AC Deluxe",
    "Price_Per_Day": 2500,
    "Available": true
}


### 3. GET ALL BOOKINGS
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/booking/


### 4. ADD BOOKING
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/booking/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Customer_Name": "Adhish",
    "Mobile": "9876543210",
    "room": 1,
    "Check_In": "2026-11-05",
    "Check_Out": "2026-11-08"
}


### 5. UPDATE BOOKING
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/booking/update/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Customer_Name": "Adhish Santhosh",
    "Mobile": "9876543210",
    "room": 1,
    "Check_In": "2026-11-05",
    "Check_Out": "2026-11-09"
}


### 6. DELETE BOOKING
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/booking/delete/1/